{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01527","headline":"琴曲歌辞 雉朝飞操 · 李白","name":"琴曲歌辞 雉朝飞操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麦陇青青三月时，白雉朝飞挟两雌。\n锦衣绮翼何离褷，犊牧采薪感之悲。\n春天和，白日暖，啄食饮泉勇气满。\n争雄鬬死绣颈断，雉子班奏急管弦，心倾美酒尽玉椀。\n枯杨枯杨尔生荑，我独七十而孤栖。\n弹弦写恨意不尽，瞑目归黄泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}